# QA screenshots are large PNGs regenerated by scripts/qa/shot.mjs; keep them
# local so the repo stays lean. Regenerate with the loop in scripts/qa/README.md.
#
# All three directories are ignored, and it matters that they ALL are: baseline/
# was correctly ignored while current/ (18MB) and review/ were accidentally
# committed by a `git add -A`, which is exactly backwards — versioning a run's
# transient OUTPUT while its reference is local-only.
scripts/qa/baseline/*.png
scripts/qa/current/*.png
scripts/qa/review/*.png
